OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,11,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,12,     Gbeyond, including Beethoven's
OL,13,     GEroica Symphony and Mahler's
OL,14,     GBlumine.
OL,15,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,16,     GThe world plunges into war, with
OL,17,     GHungary at the centre. Donald
OL,18,     GMacleod explores the life of one
OL,19,     Gof Hungary's greatest composers,
OL,20,     Gwho travelled Europe recording
OL,21,     Gfolk songs.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
