OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GLive music from The United
OL,6,     GStrings of Europe. Anna Clyne on
OL,7,     Gthe world premiere of her work
OL,8,     GSirens.
OL,9,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,10,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,11,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,12,     Gfavourites from composers such as
OL,13,     GMendelssohn, Scarlatti and Mel
OL,14,     GBonis.
OL,15,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     GSir Mark Elder is reunited with
OL,17,     Gthe Halle Orchestra and Choir in
OL,18,     Ga programme of music by Glinka,
OL,19,     GRachmaninov, Stravinsky, and
OL,20,     GTchaikovsky.
