OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,5,     GThe Essay celebrates the
OL,6,     Gmusicality of Earth's insect
OL,7,     Gsingers. Autumn Cricket Song. A
OL,8,     Gbeautiful song of stridulation
OL,9,     Gthat begins in summer and edges
OL,10,     Ginto the melancholy of autumn.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GAlice Zawazdki selects a swirling
OL,19,     Grelease from the Danish bass
OL,20,     Gplayer.
